{10}{Uh...whatever, Magnus.  I think we not stay together any more...}{}{-4}{}{-4}{}
{12}{[Grumbling.]  Yes, I suppose I'll travel with you a while...}{[Grumbling.]  Yes, I suppose I'll travel with you a while...}{}{3}{}{}
